WEBVTT

00:11:29.361 --> 00:11:31.301
(Laughter)

00:11:32.523 --> 00:11:35.824
That's inconceivable, of course.

00:11:36.848 --> 00:11:38.078
But suppose --

00:11:38.102 --> 00:11:41.148
[Supporters of the Asteroid Theory
cannot be patriotic citizens]

00:11:41.172 --> 00:11:42.887
(Laughter)

00:11:42.911 --> 00:11:45.530
(Applause)

00:11:47.774 --> 00:11:50.976
In 1987, a reporter asked George Bush, Sr.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.818
whether he recognized
the equal citizenship and patriotism

00:11:54.842 --> 00:11:56.976
of Americans who are atheists.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.976
Mr. Bush's reply has become infamous.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:03.976
"No, I don't know that atheists
should be considered citizens,